#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:5 1a2fb978366347d687e3e1cda55853a1
msgid "ARCHIVED: Analog Sonar (AC3.1)"
msgstr "已归档：模拟声纳（AC3.1）"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:7 a78e0d99967443e88578056d9f274fb9
msgid "this document superseded by :ref:`common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog`"
msgstr "本文档已被 :ref:`common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog` 取代"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:9 684e43cf19b74e08b94c606ffb91cf5c
msgid ""
"Copter supports the MaxSonar line of sonar sensors for \"Terrain Following\""
" while in Loiter or Alt Hold modes.  In these modes, the copter will attempt"
" to maintain a constant distance from the ground. The sonar is also used "
"during :ref:`LAND <land-mode>` mode.  The copter will slow its descent to "
"50cm/s (configurable with LAND_SPEED parameter) when the sonar detects "
"something below the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Copter 支持 MaxSonar 系列声纳传感器，可在 Loiter 或 Alt Hold "
"模式下实现\"地形跟随\"。在这些模式下，飞机将尝试保持与地面的固定距离。声纳也在 :ref:`LAND <land-mode>` "
"模式下使用，当声纳检测到飞行器下方有物体时，飞机将降低下降速度至 50cm/s（可通过 LAND_SPEED 参数配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:23 e996b00e25a74b18b6c33d624a0ee1a6
msgid ""
"RNGFND_MAX_CM must be set to a tested, appropriate value.  If RNGFND_MAX_CM "
"is set to a value greater than the range of the sensor, the autopilot will "
"not respond correctly to the data provided."
msgstr ""
"RNGFND_MAX_CM 必须设置为经过测试的适当值。如果 RNGFND_MAX_CM 设置的值超过传感器的量程，飞控将无法正确响应所提供的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:28 96b5f4307473449a9845b28b46e4cb80
msgid "Supported Sonars"
msgstr "支持的声纳型号"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:30 4b7d7a0e77f34f7d811c95723d539531
msgid ""
"The Maxbotix recommended Sonar for Multicopter use is the `MaxBotix XL-EZ4 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1240.htm>`__ (aka MB1240) "
"which has a 7.65m max range and a narrow beam which helps reduce the chance "
"of interference from other sources of sound at the same frequency."
msgstr ""
"Maxbotix 为多旋翼推荐的声纳是 `MaxBotix XL-EZ4 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1240.htm>`__ （即 MB1240），最大量程为"
" 7.65m，采用窄波束设计，有助于减少同频率其他声源的干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:34 e0dd5635c98b4a289223f8869d47ab43
msgid ""
"It is definitely worth reading the `Interfacing an Ultrasonic Sensor with a "
"Pixhawk or ArduPilot Mega <https://www.maxbotix.com/articles/ultrasonic-"
"sensors-pixhawk-ardupilot.htm>`__ article by Maxbotix."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议阅读 Maxbotix 撰写的 `Interfacing an Ultrasonic Sensor with a Pixhawk or "
"ArduPilot Mega <https://www.maxbotix.com/articles/ultrasonic-sensors-"
"pixhawk-ardupilot.htm>`__ 一文。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:36 e5d92ef46c8043a8b35a5e2277fd8e5e
msgid "These other sonar are also supported:"
msgstr "以下声纳型号也受支持："

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:38 e36ad1d0e8e742e68853f026ce05979f
msgid ""
"`XL-EZL0 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1260.htm>`__ (10.68m"
" max range but lower resolution, also XLL)"
msgstr ""
"`XL-EZL0 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1260.htm>`__ （最大量程 "
"10.68m，但分辨率较低，另有 XLL 型号）"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:40 4c0eb45ea8104e7987cc714ec8239d48
msgid ""
"`HRLV-EZ4 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11309>`__ (5m max range but "
"higher resolution, also HRLV-EZ0)"
msgstr ""
"`HRLV-EZ4 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11309>`__ （最大量程 5m，但分辨率更高，另有 "
"HRLV-EZ0 型号）"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:42 440d6f42b0a2436993d26a8cd9f2838c
msgid ""
"`LV-EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1040.htm>`__ (6.45m "
"max range, cheaper but less resistant to noise, also LV_EZ0)"
msgstr ""
"`LV-EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1040.htm>`__ （最大量程 "
"6.45m，价格较低但抗噪声能力较弱，另有 LV_EZ0 型号）"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:45 def93498257e4fd0af51978c04769045
msgid "We do not yet support I2C based MaxBotix sonars."
msgstr "我们目前尚不支持基于 I2C 接口的 MaxBotix 声纳。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:48 fa07ea783e384b95aaae0e192d25532a
msgid "Building a cable to reduce sonar noise"
msgstr "制作降低声纳噪声的线缆"

