#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:62 2b6cf0c8d6ed44c29c1dc34663428103
msgid "Connecting the Sonar Sensor on APM 2.x"
msgstr "在 APM 2.x 上连接声纳传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:64 147ba05cfdaf438d979a52438843aaac
msgid ""
"The sensor's GND, V+ and \"AN\" or \"3\" pins should be connected to APM 2's"
" A0 pins as shown in the diagram below:"
msgstr "传感器的 GND、V+ 和\"AN\"或\"3\"引脚应如下图所示连接到 APM 2 的 A0 引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:71 457071ce5c6342fda3171543242fc2de
msgid "Connecting the Sonar Sensor on PX4FMU"
msgstr "在 PX4FMU 上连接声纳传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:73 9addff4f4b6d4301bdf94ee127d9a9fc
msgid ""
"You will need to assign the Sonar (signal line) to an appropriate PX4 pin in"
" Mission Planner - Configuration - Advanced Params - Adv Parameter List "
"using the SONAR_PIN parameter.  The following PX4 \"Pins\" are available for"
" SONAR use."
msgstr ""
"您需要在 Mission Planner - Configuration - Advanced Params - Adv Parameter List "
"中使用 SONAR_PIN 参数，将声纳（信号线）分配到适当的 PX4 引脚。以下 PX4\"引脚\"可用于声纳连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:77 38b989d23f374c3e963cef772f4050cd
msgid "SONAR_PIN = 11 - (recommended)"
msgstr "SONAR_PIN = 11 -（推荐）"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:79 74f1ce22230f492f914a19cc39e3a1a0
msgid ""
"The \"airspeed\" pin. Located on a 3 pin DF13 connector on the PX4IO board, "
"but directly visible to the ADC on the PX4FMU. This pin can take voltages up"
" to 6.6V (it has an internal voltage divider)."
msgstr ""
"空速\"引脚。位于 PX4IO 板上的 3 针 DF13 连接器上，但 PX4FMU 的 ADC 可直接访问。此引脚最高可承受 6.6V 电压（内置电压分压器）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4713, \"zh\": \"SONAR_PIN = 12\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4714, \"zh\": \"通用模拟输入引脚。位于 PX4IO 板\"FMUSPI\"端口的第 3 引脚，PX4FMU 模拟输入代码可直接访问。最高可承受 3.3V 电压。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4715, \"zh\": \"SONAR_PIN = 13\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4716, \"zh\": \"通用模拟输入引脚。位于 PX4IO 板\"FMUSPI\"端口的第 4 引脚，PX4FMU 模拟输入代码可直接访问。最高可承受 3.3V 电压。该功能正在开发中，完成后将在本节更新。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4717, \"zh\": \"安装声纳传感器\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4718, \"zh\": \"声纳传感器的安装位置必须距离电气噪声来源（包括 ESC 和其他干扰源）至少三英寸（10cm）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4719, \"zh\": \"通过 Mission Planner 启用声纳\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4720, \"zh\": \"将 APM/PX4 连接到 Mission Planner 后，按以下步骤启用声纳：\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4721, \"zh\": \"进入 Initial Setup > Optional Hardware > Sonar\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4722, \"zh\": \"勾选\"Enable\"复选框\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4723, \"zh\": \"从下拉列表中选择声纳型号\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4724, \"zh\": \"测试声纳\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 4725, \"zh\": \"您可以通过将 APM/PX4 连接到 Mission Planner 后按以下步骤基本测试声纳是否正常工作：\"}"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:82 d489f7327e2643f6a66d96ec952b18da
msgid "SONAR_PIN = 12"
msgstr "SONAR_PIN = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:84 983b5cde7c0347109c4844f381683ee0
msgid ""
"A general analog input pin. Located on pin 3 of the \"FMUSPI\" port on the "
"PX4IO board, this pin is directly visible to the PX4FMU analog input code. "
"This can take voltages up to 3.3V."
msgstr ""
"通用模拟输入引脚。位于 PX4IO 板 「FMUSPI」 端口的引脚 3，该引脚对 PX4FMU 模拟输入代码直接可见。可承受最高 3.3V 的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:88 63554d68572f41ef816bfcaecb264bee
msgid "SONAR_PIN = 13"
msgstr "SONAR_PIN = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:90 0bdc1d6cbeed4ed78a4775c154a5f25c
msgid ""
"A general analog input pin. Located on pin 4 of the \"FMUSPI\" port on the "
"PX4IO board, this pin is directly visible to the PX4FMU analog input code. "
"This can take voltages up to 3.3V.  It is being worked on and will be "
"included in this section when it is available."
msgstr ""
"通用模拟输入引脚。位于 PX4IO 板 「FMUSPI」 端口的引脚 4，该引脚对 PX4FMU 模拟输入代码直接可见。可承受最高 3.3V "
"的电压。该引脚正在完善中，待功能可用后将补充至本节。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:96 d1ec6381655a4cd8b27ae429866d2c20
msgid "Mounting the Sonar Sensor"
msgstr "安装声呐传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:98 7800a9bbd8d34866bb6d256d83934ad2
msgid ""
"It's important that the sonar sensor be mounted at least three inches (10cm)"
" away from sources of electrical noise including the ESCs and other "
"interference."
msgstr "声呐传感器必须与电噪声源（包括 ESC 及其他干扰源）保持至少三英寸（10 厘米）的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:102 1c9b7f87edc14ac1a1205479a0e62574
msgid "Enabling the Sonar through Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 启用声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:104 8cee188f06fa4437b4ea9581141bb70a
msgid ""
"Enable the sonar by connecting your APM/PX4 to the Mission Planner and then:"
msgstr "将您的 APM/PX4 连接至 Mission Planner，然后按以下步骤启用声呐："

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:106 d9c57a2bf77a46c19f4be3da6b83b6d3
msgid "Go to Initial Setup > Optional Hardware > Sonar"
msgstr "前往 初始设置 > 可选硬件 > 声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:107 744c2f7366d54970bdf7d575acf65dd5
msgid "Check the \"Enable\" checkbox"
msgstr "勾选 「Enable」 复选框"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:108 a6209986ba004713b49ecc6418d88b80
msgid "Select the sonar model from the drop down list"
msgstr "从下拉列表中选择声呐型号"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:114 ad34764e9dfa492cb605f720d0f14465
msgid "Testing the sonar"
msgstr "测试声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:116 a380ac43b2fb4b1a9eeea481622eff51
msgid ""
"You can test the sonar basically works by connecting your APM/PX4 to the "
"mission planner and then:"
msgstr "您可以通过将 APM/PX4 连接至 Mission Planner 来基本测试声呐是否正常工作，然后："

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:119 0a4f97a536fa499ca88f6f860937d068
msgid "Go to the Terminal window and press \"Connect to APM\" or \"Connect to PX4\""
msgstr "进入终端窗口，点击\"Connect to APM\"或\"Connect to PX4\""

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:120 a84b2365cd4949d0b1cc6ee41e4adcda
msgid "when the prompt appears type *test*"
msgstr "当提示符出现时，输入 *test*"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:121 9e42970a32d148a7afd6c8c090d5cda1
msgid "type *sonar*"
msgstr "输入 *sonar*"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:123 4355bc8a6a5c4e01986ca7dccae60355
msgid ""
"The current distanced sensed by the sonar should be displayed.  Aim the "
"sonar at targets of different distances (i.e. ceiling, wall, etc) and ensure"
" the numbers change.  If they do not then there may be a hardware issue with"
" the sonar or cabling."
msgstr ""
"声纳当前感测到的距离应会显示出来。将声纳对准不同距离的目标（如天花板、墙壁等），确认数值会随之变化。如果数值不变，则声纳或线缆可能存在硬件问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:128 8176c61fc81c46e988330a5701ce3fe3
msgid ""
"You should also hear the sonar clicking very rapidly (10hz) whenever power "
"is applied if you do not hear this then it's possible that the sonar is "
"defective or is not being powered for some reason."
msgstr "通电后，您也应该能听到声纳发出非常快速的咔哒声（10Hz）。如果听不到，可能是声纳故障或因某种原因未获得供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:133 aa384128f32d4e5f82b0d8c6a1164a67
msgid "Tuning the gain"
msgstr "调整增益"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:135 08a1a143d5564743a1e78290ff81aee4
msgid ""
"If when flying you find that your copter bobs up and down it is possible "
"that the default SONAR_GAIN is too high for your copter.  Go to the mission "
"planner's Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List and reduce the SONAR_GAIN "
"parameter from its default of 0.2 to 0.1 or even 0.05 and press \"Write "
"Params\"."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行时飞机出现上下颠簸，可能是默认的 SONAR_GAIN 对您的飞机来说过高。进入 Mission Planner 的 Config/Tuning"
" > Full Parameter List，将 SONAR_GAIN 参数从默认值 0.2 降低到 0.1 甚至 0.05，然后点击\"Write "
"Params\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:142 1a4b68e60b734225abd7f0bc1e4c5211
msgid "Sonar Maximum Altitude"
msgstr "声纳最大高度"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:144 2352f997566345d798589d77d400bf9e
msgid ""
"When enabled Sonar is used as the means of determining altitude below Sonar "
"Maximum Altitude, above that the barometer is used."
msgstr "启用后，在声纳最大高度以下时使用声纳来确定高度，超过该高度则使用气压计。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:146 86682051ce9d409a847e66159c5695e5
msgid ""
"Sonar Maximum Altitude is calculated as 60 percent of the factory specified "
"maximum Sonar range for the Sonar type selected."
msgstr "声纳最大高度计算为所选声纳型号出厂标称最大量程的 60%。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:148 cd4380258e5f484aa6492865d6f45f95
msgid ""
"Sonar is used for determining altitude only when the Sonar itself is "
"detecting the ground and is below its Sonar Maximum Altitude."
msgstr "只有当声纳本身能检测到地面且位于声纳最大高度以下时，才使用声纳来确定高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:151 5ba61a102ad24a8091ce04637af9aa5d
msgid ""
"XL-EZ4 or XL-EZ0 have a Maximum range of 7.65 meters and a Sonar Maximum "
"Altitude of 4.59 meters."
msgstr "XL-EZ4 或 XL-EZ0 的最大量程为 7.65 米，声纳最大高度为 4.59 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:153 72a4b7a5b3bb4bbbb702c1f5f93cbbea
msgid ""
"XL-EZLO have a Maximum range of 10.68 meters and a Sonar Maximum Altitude = "
"6.4 meters."
msgstr "XL-EZLO 的最大量程为 10.68 米，声纳最大高度为 6.4 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:155 6fbcea2745694ec6be2e01afa537c9d5
msgid ""
"HRLV-EZ4 or HRLV-EZ0 with Maximum range of 5 meters and a Sonar Maximum "
"Altitude of 3 meters."
msgstr "HRLV-EZ4 或 HRLV-EZ0 的最大量程为 5 米，声纳最大高度为 3 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:157 ab1484287344468fa1f30b1fe3a32754
msgid ""
"LV-EZ4 or LV-EZ0 have a Maximum range of 6.45 meters and a Sonar Maximum "
"Altitude = 3.87 meters."
msgstr "LV-EZ4 或 LV-EZ0 的最大量程为 6.45 米，声纳最大高度为 3.87 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:160 d8e92d1f28fa4301a171fffc3830ad6d
msgid ""
"If the Sonar gets an unreliable return below the Sonar Maximum Altitude, it "
"is ignored and the Barometer altitude is used."
msgstr "如果声纳在声纳最大高度以下获得不可靠的返回值，该值将被忽略，转而使用气压计高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:164 d80c2e4179524bdc9418e6ffa23ce865
msgid "Cold weather performance"
msgstr "低温环境下的性能"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:166 b88fefbcf98e4a09b65a3480b6b25ce5
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MaxBotix <common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog>` XL-EZ0 sonar (and "
"other variations of their indoor sonar) may not function for about 10 "
"minutes after an extreme drop in temperature (i.e. a drop from a warm "
"27C/80F house to the chilly 10C/50F outdoors) because of condensation "
"building up on the sensor."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MaxBotix <common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog>` XL-EZ0 "
"声纳（及其室内声纳的其他变体）在温度急剧下降（例如从温暖的 27℃/80℉ 室内转移到寒冷的 10℃/50℉ "
"户外）后，可能因传感器表面凝结水珠而无法正常工作约 10 分钟。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:172 8ca98a61cb944783a8968713e888c073
msgid ""
"`This post "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-48?xg_source=activity&id=705844%3ATopic%3A676942&page=31#comments>`__"
" includes one member's (`Geir Engebakken "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topic/listForContributor?user=3a28calx54gma>`__)"
" solution (initially suggested by the developer Olivier ADLER) involving "
"attaching 4x10Ohm resistors to the base of the sonar powered from a 5V "
"source."
msgstr ""
"`这篇帖子 "
"<https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arducopter-2-0-48?xg_source=activity&id=705844%3ATopic%3A676942&page=31#comments>`__"
" 包含了一位成员（`Geir Engebakken "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/forum/topic/listForContributor?user=3a28calx54gma>`__）的解决方案（最初由开发者"
" Olivier ADLER 提出），该方案是将 4 个 10 欧姆电阻连接到声纳底座，并由 5V 电源供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:179 7036f21483dc46c3ac4461910f654510
msgid "Other Potential Causes of Sonar Noise"
msgstr "其他可能导致声纳噪声的原因"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:181 fbd8d90c6e994426b56aad82b3db3dff
msgid ""
"If you are having problems with excessive noise on your sonar as shown in "
"the dataflash log below (sonar is in red, baro is in green)"
msgstr "如果您遇到如下 dataflash 日志所示的声纳噪声过大问题（声纳为红色，气压计为绿色）"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:187 db957ca4a1b0483e9fbd2dbdfbc4b710
msgid "There are a number of possible causes which should be investigated:"
msgstr "以下是一些需要排查的可能原因："

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:189 25c669f1ef844013a298d615c30b79e4
msgid ""
"Sonar is susceptible to \"noise\" from a variety of sources and several "
"\"fixes\" may be required to achieve adequate performance."
msgstr "声纳容易受到各种来源的\"噪声\"影响，可能需要采取多种\"修复\"措施才能达到满意的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:192 7429f3ec9a5e423cb28698e2b910bdf6
msgid ""
"Electrical noise caused by ESCs, Servos, or switching BEC's on the same "
"circuit as the Sonar."
msgstr "与声纳处于同一电路上的 ESC、舵机或开关型 BEC 引起的电气噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:195 8446b20a1aeb4c1f81abfa6090c8370a
msgid ""
"The RC filter and use of shielded cable as described above are usually "
"sufficient."
msgstr "如上所述，使用 RC 滤波器和屏蔽线缆通常就足够了。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:198 0e970b8aea19455ea70cd759dc12d477
msgid "EMF radiation from motors, motor wires, ESC's or Xbee."
msgstr "电机、电机导线、ESC 或 Xbee 产生的 EMF 辐射。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:200 6c86b7860f5a45f788a7153e9960c640
msgid ""
"Sonar is especially susceptible to AC EMF noise generated by the ESCs and "
"ESC to motor wiring."
msgstr "声纳对 ESC 及 ESC 到电机接线产生的交流 EMF 噪声特别敏感。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:202 bd19cf6a75ab4da3872166739a13b8a2
msgid ""
"This can be greatly reduced by wrapping the nearby ESCs and their motor "
"wiring in aluminum (gutter) tape."
msgstr "用铝箔（排水槽）胶带包裹附近的 ESC 及其电机接线，可以大幅减少此类噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:205 596f1de272344da18a288dca4138461b
msgid "Acoustic noise from propellers, prop wash and turbulence."
msgstr "螺旋桨、桨洗气流和湍流产生的声学噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:207 1405e1ce39c24e69a3d0f86961d8f513
msgid ""
"It is very important to keep the Sonar out of direct prop wash or "
"turbulence."
msgstr "务必使声纳远离直接的桨洗气流或湍流。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:209 585892dbb0834c42b25354355bf60954
msgid "Balancing propellers (and motors) can help."
msgstr "平衡螺旋桨（和电机）有助于减少噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:210 389cc7af6d5c49e2a8cb7a11590d420f
msgid ""
"Mounting the sonar sensor inside a small can or tube thinly lined with foam "
"can greatly reduce unwanted exterior acoustic noise."
msgstr "将声纳传感器安装在内衬薄泡沫的小罐或管中，可以大幅减少外部不需要的声学噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:212 088d4e09de8e4bd2b7816017fdc8a107
msgid ""
"Wrap Sonar module board and components in rubber or foam tape to reduce "
"transferred acoustic noise."
msgstr "用橡胶或泡沫胶带包裹声纳模块电路板和组件，以减少传导的声学噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:215 eb432d4bcd66488cbba13f876bf223f9
msgid "Vibration from motors, props, etc."
msgstr "电机、螺旋桨等产生的震动。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:217 ee44fb45bbd642fb8a0d14a25ab3374f
msgid "Sonar is very subject to frame transmitted vibration."
msgstr "声纳极易受到机架传导震动的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:218 de864582b0024af9a2dc087486893b5d
msgid ""
"Mounting the Sonar module on double sided foam or Gel tape will pretty much "
"eliminate this noise source."
msgstr "将声纳模块安装在双面泡沫胶或凝胶胶带上，基本可以消除此类噪声来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:221 f4f853bae73845cba51522d588ec8695
msgid ""
"The MB 1240 series is the only Sonar considered suitable for multicopter use"
" by the manufacturer - Maxbotix."
msgstr "MB 1240 系列是制造商 Maxbotix 认为唯一适合多旋翼使用的声纳产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/sonar.rst:226 d147a001c0e84f4897e3eb8b04b569b8
msgid ""
"Please read this tutorial for a comprehensive review: `Interfacing an "
"Ultrasonic Sensor with a Pixhawk or ArduPilot Mega "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/articles/ultrasonic-sensors-pixhawk-"
"ardupilot.htm>`__."
msgstr ""
"请阅读此教程进行全面了解：`Interfacing an Ultrasonic Sensor with a Pixhawk or ArduPilot "
"Mega <https://www.maxbotix.com/articles/ultrasonic-sensors-pixhawk-"
"ardupilot.htm>`__。"
